{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52299","headline":"诗（幷序） 六十 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前业作因缘，[今]（金）身都不记。\n今也（项、郭校「世」）受苦拙（张改作「恼」），[未]（末）来当富贵。\n不是後身奴，来生作事地。\n不如多温酒，相逢一时醉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}